   So consider the geometric meaning for the answer.
   f(a,b) is equal to the way to go from (0,0) to (a,b).
   So f(Ai+Aj,Bi+Bj) equals to the way to go from (-Ai,-Bi) to (Aj,Bj).
   Do simple DP to solve it.
   And what's more,
   if the total answer is X,
   ans=(X-sigma(1<=i<=N,f(Ai*2,Bi*2)))/2,
   and f(Ai*2,Bi*2) can be got by pre-calculating the C(a,b).
*/
